From 062add1f43a75102e0ad252679f7035d0e77e23b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@st.com>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 19:19:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 478/572] fix(platforms): check MIN_SGI_ID at compile time

MIN_SGI_ID is 0 by default in GICv2. It could then be useless to check
if an SGI interrupt ID is above this, as the ID is already an unsigned
int.
This avoids the following warning when enabling W=1 in the command line.
plat/common/plat_gicv2.c:180:20: warning: comparison of unsigned
expression in '>= 0' is always true [-Wtype-limits]
  180 |         return (id >= MIN_SGI_ID) && (id < MIN_PPI_ID);
      |                    ^~

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 57448c9ad9d0f64d94aa4433d1404d3211ce1558 fix(platforms): check MIN_SGI_ID at compile time]
Change-Id: I45a51eaa1894d2723476e9c0dedb90a2540854de
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/571867
Reviewed-by: Maxime MERE <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Tested-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
---
 plat/common/plat_gicv2.c | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/plat/common/plat_gicv2.c b/plat/common/plat_gicv2.c
index 1edccd144b..d00c72c4e6 100644
--- a/plat/common/plat_gicv2.c
+++ b/plat/common/plat_gicv2.c
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 /*
- * Copyright (c) 2015-2023, Arm Limited and Contributors. All rights reserved.
+ * Copyright (c) 2015-2026, Arm Limited and Contributors. All rights reserved.
  * Portions copyright (c) 2021-2022, ProvenRun S.A.S. All rights reserved.
  *
  * SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
@@ -177,7 +177,11 @@ bool plat_ic_is_ppi(unsigned int id)
 
 bool plat_ic_is_sgi(unsigned int id)
 {
+#if (MIN_SGI_ID > 0)
 	return (id >= MIN_SGI_ID) && (id < MIN_PPI_ID);
+#else
+	return (id < MIN_PPI_ID);
+#endif
 }
 
 unsigned int plat_ic_get_interrupt_active(unsigned int id)
